<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Ho Hup 6-month net up 44 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Ho Hup 6-month net up 44 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  14.05   vs	   9.75</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)     23.4    vs	  16.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		   259.97   vs	 178.33</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    21.48   vs	  14.31</p>
<p>    Minorities	    add  0.99   vs    add  0.36</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)	 -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Ho Hup Construction Co Ltd is a civil and building engineering contractor and machinery distributor.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
